     "value": "Homodimer (PubMed:20689065). Heteromultimer with KCNN2 and KCNN3 (PubMed:20689065, PubMed:9287325). The complex is composed of 4 channel subunits each of which binds to a calmodulin subunit which regulates the channel activity through calcium-binding (By similarity). Interacts with calmodulin (By similarity)"
